  "headline": "Calcium chloride is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the rule‑ranked alternate is ICU Medical Inc.",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows calcium chloride is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 459 syringes of calcium chloride 100 mg/mL 10 mL at 15.6 per day, giving 29.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 245 syringes at 15.1 per day, giving 16.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current label for NDC 00409163110 names Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) as the registered manufacturing plant, last inspected with NAI classification on 2025-02-07.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant include OAI classifications in 2010 and 2011 and VAI classifications from 2009 through 2019.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E5", "E7", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Hospira, Inc. on 2010-04-12.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked alternate manufacturer is ICU Medical Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
